OL,3,GNEWSA'Summer was a wake-up call, winter
OL,4,Acould be dire' warning over food
OL,5,Asupplies
OL,6,
OL,7,FDuncan Fisher is behind Our Food Trust,
OL,8,Fwhich wants to build 100 farms,
OL,9,Fproducing fruit and vegetables in Wales
OL,10,Ffor local markets.
